{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Fireworks\uff08\u6307\u5c16\u70df\u82b1\uff09</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE! CROUCH! BOOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/4f6bfef9ebecaec688c78314d542d40e.poster.avif?t=1760676422\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/4f6bfef9ebecaec688c78314d542d40e.webm?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/4f6bfef9ebecaec688c78314d542d40e.mp4?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only move to adjacent keys. Moving over keys will make you trip and fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and hold your current key to crouch and light the fuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crucial!</strong> After igniting the fuse, make sure to escape the danger zone before it explodes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Fireworks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.poster.avif?t=1760676422\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.webm?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.mp4?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fireworks light up the sky, press and hold the SPACE to look up and enjoy the show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> You'll earn bonus points for watching!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.poster.avif?t=1760676422\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.webm?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.mp4?t=1760676422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random tiles will break! Stepping on them will make you trip, fall, and lose points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your path!\u00a0The aim is higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907070?t=1760676422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/e2297f0f7c84754cc8932734b391ef25d547a7cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760676422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/b6d8786157d68acecd5611a08ddf0083b3373c7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760676422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907070/b6d8786157d68acecd5611a08ddf0083b3373c7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760676422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Fireworks\uff08\u6307\u5c16\u70df\u82b1\uff09</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE! CROUCH! BOOM!</stro